{"format":1,"key":"zone:orgrimmar","path":"/lore/zone/orgrimmar","name":"Orgrimmar","kind":"zone","label":"Capital","zone":{"key":"orgrimmar","name":"Orgrimmar","path":"/lore/zone/orgrimmar"},"levels":"","description":"Orgrimmar is the fortress capital of the orcs and the beating heart of Thrall's New Horde. Carved directly into the towering red-rock canyons of northern…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:orgrimmar","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Orgrimmar is the fortress capital of the orcs and the beating heart of Thrall's New Horde. Carved directly into the towering red-rock canyons of northern Durotar, the fortified city stands as a monument to orcish perseverance and an unyielding sanctuary for trolls, tauren, and Forsaken allies alike.","Following the Third War, Warchief Thrall led the orcs to the arid coasts of Kalimdor to build a homeland free from demonic corruption and human bondage. Naming the harsh region Durotar after his father, Thrall established Orgrimmar in memory of his fallen mentor, Orgrim Doomhammer. Raising the city required blood and sweat; aided by the tauren, the Darkspear trolls, goblin engineers, and the Champion Rexxar, the Horde drove back encroaching centaur, harpies, and ferocious thunder lizards to secure the canyon stronghold.","Orgrimmar is naturally fortified by rugged mountains that shield it from both foreign invaders and the violent razor-winds sweeping through Durotar. The settlement is partitioned into distinct natural hollows. The Valley of Strength serves as the bustling civic gatehouse, leading deeper into the trade bazaar of The Drag. Tauren druids and shaman congregate in the serene pools of the Valley of Wisdom, while Darkspear shadow hunters and witch doctors dwell among the stilted pavilions of the Valley of Spirits."],"hash":"3d5e0c","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"a1f4f2fed5","sec":78},"female-narrator":{"sha":"e2643f7cfb","sec":83}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Orgrimmar","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Orgrimmar"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/thrall","n":"Thrall","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/orgrim-doomhammer","n":"Orgrim Doomhammer","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/zone/durotar","n":"Durotar","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/ragefire","n":"Ragefire Chasm","k":"dungeon"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/grommash-hold","n":"Grommash Hold","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/cleft-of-shadow","n":"Cleft of Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/topic/new-horde","n":"New Horde","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/npc/vol-jin","n":"Vol'jin","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/97957-camping-101-herbalism","n":"Camping 101: Herbalism","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/97960-camping-101-skinning","n":"Camping 101: Skinning","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/greatfather-winter","n":"Greatfather Winter","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bladefist-bay","n":"Bladefist Bay","k":"subzone"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/cleft-of-shadow","n":"Cleft of Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/drag","n":"Drag","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/gates-of-orgrimmar","n":"Gates of Orgrimmar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/grommash-hold","n":"Grommash Hold","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hall-of-legends","n":"Hall of Legends","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hall-of-the-brave","n":"Hall of the Brave","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ragefire-chasm","n":"Ragefire Chasm","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ragefire-chasm-classic","n":"Ragefire Chasm (Classic)","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/valley-of-honor","n":"Valley of Honor","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/valley-of-spirits","n":"Valley of Spirits","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/valley-of-strength","n":"Valley of Strength","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/aelthalyste","n":"Aelthalyste","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/cazul","n":"Cazul","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/craven-drok","n":"Craven Drok","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/deino","n":"Deino","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dirge-quikcleave","n":"Dirge Quikcleave","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/doras","n"